      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "3 grams of fat. Saturated fat is only 0.6 grams, so the fat profile is pretty clean. Omega 3 is just 20 milligrams, though, so there is basically no seed-style fat upside here. For grains, fat is generally all around low anyway.",
