    {
      "id": "04-carbs",
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "carbs",
      "text": "81.5 grams of carbs. Starch is 77 grams, so rice cakes do bring quick staple-carb energy. But the glycemic index is 82, which is rough for steadier carb behaviour, and 4.3 grams of fibre is not enough to rescue it. Carb quality matters most for grains.",
