    {
      "id": "05-proteins",
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "proteins",
      "text": "7 grams of protein. The essential amino acids score is 0 out of 9, and the nonessential amino acids score is 0 out of 11, so this is not doing much as a protein food, but this is to be expected. For grains, protein can help, but rice cakes are mostly just puffed carb.",
