      "index": 5,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "vitamins",
      "text": "Vitamins are low overall. Vitamin E is only 1% daily value, and there is no meaningful vitamin backup here. For grains, that is not automatically fatal, but rice cakes do not make up for it elsewhere.",
