    {
      "id": "08-pros",
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "pros",
      "text": "Positives first: portable and convenient. Very easy to use as a quick snack base. Easy to portion and carry. Thanks to the simple packaging advantage. Works with many toppings. Practical flexibility for snack content.",
