    {
      "id": "09-cons",
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "cons",
      "text": "Downsides next: does not justify taking up your grain slot. Other grain foods usually bring much more actual nutritional value. Usually needs help to feel worthwhile. It often relies on toppings or pairings to become a decent snack. Not very filling for the calories. Can be unsatisfying unless built up with other foods.",
      "textSha256": "dbcadc60f92f88a69b2f79273803b9d47d410b8945d5b1cd278a17a55d7ba06f",
