    {
      "id": "10-closing_summary",
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "closing_summary",
      "sectionKey": null,
      "text": "Best bits are convenience, portability, and easy topping flexibility. Weak spots are the high glycemic index, low protein quality, weak vitamins, and weak minerals. Best as a light snack base or texture food, not as a strong staple by itself.",
